OL,3,GNEWSAHow Manchester Pride evolved from
OL,4,Aa bring-and-buy sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FManchester Village Pride may look and
OL,7,Ffeel familiar this year but a lot has
OL,8,Fchanged over the past 12 months.
OL,10,FThe annual event, held over the August
OL,11,Fbank holiday weekend, hit the headlines
OL,12,Fin October 2025 when the company behind
OL,13,Fit went into voluntary administration.
OL,15,FManchester Pride Events LTD owed more
OL,16,Fthan #1m to suppliers and performers.
OL,18,FMany of these have still not been paid
OL,19,Fand the Charity Commission has launched
OL,20,Fan investigation into the
OL,21,Forganisation's finances.
